        {
          "type": "assistant",
          "text": "I’m creating the adjacent note now. Its core frame will be “one personal home, many governed mounts” versus the genuinely federated alternatives—not a disguised endorsement of the first idea. I’ll preserve the rejected models and their failure modes because that is the useful research, not just the eventual answer.",
